{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate casts its dice\u2014and I see. I see that you'll take on the role of a girl. Hair like fire, born in a black hut near the graveyard. It's no easy role, and your choices are many: will you be kind and gentle, or wild and willful? Will you serve others, or seek only your own gain? Or maybe you\u2019ll walk a third path\u2026 Time will tell. Your fate is yours alone. It depends on you\u2014and your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A text-based RPG set in a <strong>free-form Slavic fantasy world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited freedom of choice</strong> \u2013 Every decision shapes the story, creating a unique experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 Unlock different outcomes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intriguing story</strong> \u2013 A tale that changes and deepens with each choice</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u0412\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u0430\u044f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909690/8a9efda5c7cc9c8c4b47d19c3e468c899ed778b2.jpg"},{"name":"\u041f\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0430","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909690/6a2794d1f1bc6ccf8bec6f9540d76b899f3653af.jpg"},{"name":"\u041d\u0430\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0430","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909690/fa068e28341c93c8bc5482845045709534d3d014.jpg"},{"name":"\u041f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043f\u0435\u0447\u043d\u0430\u044f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909690/51d2bcf6ca5dd72bd8dbf41359290b860d264885.jpg"},{"name":"\u0412\u0438\u0434\u044f\u0449\u0430\u044f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co